{"3498500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stench", "steam_appid": 3498500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498500/extras/6deece9b8a3f61e22c0cf502cbdd4e71.avif?t=1764929850\" width=616 height=128 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Some people are troublemakers. Others are trouble magnets.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i>The diagnosis is in: <strong>Jeff</strong> has the <strong>STENCH</strong>, a mysterious disease that makes him attract problems. As if that wasn't enough, he just moved to the City... and now has to deal with its extravagant citizens, an idiotic street gang, a secret government agency, and an obscure cult.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498500/extras/ba2399574c92cc8ad90aa8af4f7b1e71.avif?t=1764929850\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day by day, choose how to spend your time. But keep an eye on your watch, because the City changes its face when darkness falls.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, discover new locations, solve puzzles, and find secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the locals, make friends, make enemies... Maybe find love.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498500/extras/dab5ce53e67d131641dd6701002075cc.avif?t=1764929850\" width=780 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet over <strong>15</strong> unique characters, take on their silly quests, get precious clues and become part of their stories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find unlikely employers<strong>. </strong>Burn your résumé. What you'll be asked only requires total discretion and little to no survival instinct.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498500/extras/1d3cd8ff9b9629dd561f1f9599793b2f.avif?t=1764929850\" width=780 height=78 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slam thugs and monsters <strong>IN-DA-FACE!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the loot, grow stronger, get better equipment and unlock new weapons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>Big Bad Bosses</strong> and claim unique upgrades!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498500/extras/801faeeb3ec77cdd4402ca471ca62752.avif?t=1764929850\" width=780 height=74 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earthquakes have been shaking the City lately, but things may not be as they seem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the right connections, the mystery will be revealed. But who are the real allies and the real enemies?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Cult is growing in the shadow, and they don’t take ‘no’ for an answer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498500/extras/3a18587431fe38cb40eea021af324710.avif?t=1764929850\" width=780 height=76 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=